        "sid": "LEV 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishooyie Aron nkishorot o lasar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkolong e isiet neipotu Musa Aron o layiok lenyena o lpayiani le Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki ninye Aron, “Iwa iyie oloti oing'oni intayunye olasar le ng'oki o lmeregesh ntayunye olasar opejori, ore te pokira meetae oloota entioto, nintarasaa ninche te dukuya Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nijoki iltung'ana le Israel, ‘Ewaita ositima le kine, oaku olasar le ng'oki, o lashe o sitima le ker, naa ilo lari obo pooki nemetii oloata entioto, pee eaku olasar opejori ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o lkiteng o lmeregesh metaa olasar le seriani, pee ipolososo intae te dukuya Olaitoriani o enkishoroto e ntapa naipurja te ilata, amu ore taata keipang'aki intae Olaitoriani.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau ninche nena naaitanapishe Musa dukuya olng'obor le ntumo, neigutu olturrur pooki anyiku neitashe te dukuya o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Musa, “Ena bae eitanapa intae Olaitoriani pee iasiasa; naa keipang'aki intae enkitoo o Laitoriani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.7.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 7.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki Musa ajoki Aron, “Tinyikaki olperere lo lasar, nintayu olasar lino le ng'oki ino o lasar lino opejori, nintobir olning'o le sotua te nkorrok ino o too ltung'ana; niyau enkishooroto e kulo tung'ana nintayu olning'o lo sotua te nkaraki ninche; anaa enaitanapishe Olaitoriani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenyikaki Aron ilo perere lo lasar, neyieng ilo ashe lo lasar le ng'oki, te nkaraki enkorrok enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitarasaki ilayiok le Aron ninye osarge, neitadoiki ninye olkimojino lenye atua osarge nepik osarge nena mowuarak o lperere lo lasar, nebukoki ilo sarge entonata o lperere lo lasar; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake ore enkurriny o lairakuj o lkina le monyua o ilo asar le ng'oki etapejoyie ninye te nchumata olperere lo lasar, anaa enaitanapa Olaitoriani Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nkiri o lchoni nepejoo ninye te nkima tiauluo ilng'oborri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyieng ninye ilo asar opejori; neyaki ilayiok le Aron ninye osarge, neisuaaki ninye enchumata olperere lo lasar aitaman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyaki ninche ninye ilo asar opejori eitaaki rubat, o endukuya; nepejoo ninye ninche te nchumata olperere lo lasar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neituku ninye isorri e nkoshoke o loilelek nepejoo ninche tenebo ilo asar opejori te nchumata olperere lo lasar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki aitarasaa nkishorot oo ltung'ana, neya ina kine o lasar le ng'oki te nkaraki iltung'ana, neyieng ninye, neishooyo ninye te nkaraki eng'oki anaa ilo asar le dukuya le ng'oki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitarasaa ninye ilo asar opejori, neishooyo ninye te risioroto e nkitanapata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki aitarasaa ilo asar le ntapa, neiput nkaik enyena, nepejoo te nchumata olperere lo lasar, aitatashaki ilo asar opejori le nkakenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
